  "body": " Transformation definition of  Transformation domain of  Transformation codomain of  Transformation range of  Function Transformation  Domain Transformation  Codomain Transformation  Range Transformation  transformation with domain and codomain   A transformation from to is a rule that assigns to each vector in a vector in .   is called the domain of .   is called the codomain of .  For in , the vector in is the image of under .  The set of all images is the range of .  The notation means is a transformation from to .    "
