  "body": " Rotation  Rotation eigenvectors of   Let be the linear transformation that rotates counterclockwise by , and let be the matrix for . Find the eigenvalues and eigenvectors of without doing any computations.    If is any nonzero vector, then is rotated by an angle of from . Therefore, is not on the same line as , so is not an eigenvector. And of course, the zero vector is never an eigenvector.             Therefore, this matrix has no eigenvectors and eigenvalues.    This rotation matrix has no eigenvectors. Click and drag the head of to find one.     "
