  "body": " Shear multiplicities  The shear matrix has only one eigenvalue . The characteristic polynomial of is , so has algebraic multiplicity , as it is a double root of . On the other hand, we showed in that the -eigenspace of is the -axis, so the geometric multiplicity of is equal to . This matrix is not diagonalizable.   Eigenspace of the shear matrix, with multiplicities.    The identity matrix also has characteristic polynomial , so the eigenvalue has algebraic multiplicity . Since every nonzero vector in is an eigenvector of with eigenvalue , the -eigenspace is all of , so the geometric multiplicity is as well. This matrix is diagonal.   Eigenspace of the identity matrix, with multiplicities.    "
